// 为"需要演示"的片段生成动画代码（HTML + CSS + GSAP）：导演写动作脚本 → 动画师写代码 → 浏览器检查 → 错误反馈给动画师重写。
//   node scripts/gen-motion.mjs <arXiv 编号> <场景id> <起始句 id> [--model sensenova/deepseek-flash] [--out llm-test/motion-out]
// 一次生成一处（demos.json 里 from == 起始句的那一条），结果写 JSON：{ at, plan, motion:{html,css,script}, attempts, errs }
import { readFileSync, writeFileSync, mkdirSync } from "node:fs";
import { chatJson } from "./llm.mjs";
import { checkMotion } from "./motion-check.mjs";
import { estimateSec } from "./canvas-compile.mjs";
import { paperSymbols } from "./free-validate.mjs";
import { judgeMotionMulti } from "./motion-judge-multi.mjs";
import { DIRECTOR_SYSTEM, ANIMATOR_SYSTEM, directorUser, animatorUser } from "./motion-prompts.mjs";

const args = process.argv.slice(2);
const [id, sceneId, fromId] = args.filter((a) => !a.startsWith("--"));
const flag = (n, d) => (args.includes(n) ? args[args.indexOf(n) + 1] : d);
const model = flag("--model", "sensenova/deepseek-flash");
const outDir = flag("--out", "llm-test/motion-out");
const root = `projects/${id}`;
const tl = JSON.parse(readFileSync(`${root}/timeline.json`, "utf8")).scenes.find((s) => s.id === sceneId);
const plan = JSON.parse(readFileSync(`${root}/plan.json`, "utf8").replace(/^\uFEFF/, ""));
const demos = JSON.parse(readFileSync(`${root}/narration/demos.json`, "utf8"))[sceneId] ?? [];
const demo = demos.find((d) => d.from === fromId);
if (!demo) throw new Error(`demos.json 里 ${sceneId} 没有从 ${fromId} 开始的演示`);
const ids = tl.sentences.map((s) => s.id);
const texts = Object.fromEntries(tl.sentences.map((s) => [s.id, s.text]));
const a = ids.indexOf(demo.from), z = ids.indexOf(demo.to);
const sents = tl.sentences.slice(a, z + 1);
const base = estimateSec(demo.from, ids, texts);
const durSec = (sents.reduce((s, x) => s + [...x.text].length, 0) / 5) + 0.4 * (sents.length - 1);
const pj = (n) => JSON.parse(readFileSync(`${root}/paper/${n}.json`, "utf8"));
const paper = { text: readFileSync(`${root}/paper/paper.txt`, "utf8"), equations: pj("equations") };
const sym = paperSymbols(paper, plan.scenes.find((s) => s.id === sceneId)?.formulas ?? []);
const tag = plan.scenes.find((s) => s.id === sceneId)?.tag ?? sceneId;
mkdirSync(outDir, { recursive: true });

/** 把脚本里出现的 cue 解析成相对镜头起点的秒数；同时给 beats 算出时刻 */
function cuesOf(script) {
  const out = {};
  for (const m of String(script).matchAll(/cue\(\s*(["'`])([^"'`]*?)\1\s*\)/g)) {
    const ref = m[2], mm = ref.match(/^([^@]+)@(.+)$/);
    const okRef = mm && ids.slice(a, z + 1).includes(mm[1]) && texts[mm[1]].includes(mm[2].replace(/\+\d+$/, ""));
    const s = okRef || /^[A-Za-z]+\d+$/.test(ref) ? estimateSec(ref, ids, texts) : null;
    out[ref] = s === null ? NaN : s - base;
  }
  return out;
}
const beatCues = (demo.beats ?? []).map((b) => ({ ref: b.at, what: b.what, sec: estimateSec(b.at, ids, texts) - base }));

console.log(`模型 ${model}，演示 ${demo.from}${demo.to !== demo.from ? "~" + demo.to : ""}：${demo.summary}（旁白约 ${durSec.toFixed(1)} 秒）`);

// 1) 导演：动作脚本
const t0 = Date.now();
const dir = await chatJson(model, [{ role: "system", content: DIRECTOR_SYSTEM }, { role: "user", content: directorUser({ sceneId, tag, demo, sentences: sents }) }],
  (o) => {
    const errs = [];
    if (!o?.intent || !o?.stage || !Array.isArray(o.beats)) return ["必须有 intent、stage、beats"];
    if (o.beats.length < 4) errs.push("beats 至少 4 条");
    o.beats.forEach((b, i) => {
      const m = String(b.at ?? "").match(/^([^@]+)@(.+)$/);
      if (!m || !ids.slice(a, z + 1).includes(m[1])) errs.push(`beats[${i}].at 必须写成 句子id@原话，且句子在 ${demo.from}~${demo.to} 内`);
      else if (/[，。？！、：；,.?!;:“”「」（）()]/.test(m[2])) errs.push(`beats[${i}].at 的短语「${m[2]}」含标点，请只取逗号之间连续的几个字`);
      else if (!texts[m[1]].includes(m[2])) errs.push(`beats[${i}].at 的短语「${m[2]}」不在句子 ${m[1]} 的原文里（必须是原文里连续的字）`);
      if (!b.change) errs.push(`beats[${i}].change 必填`);
    });
    return errs;
  }, { maxRounds: 4, temperature: 0.5, maxTokens: 16000, tag: `mdir-${sceneId}-${fromId}`, timeoutMs: 600_000 });
if (dir.errors?.length) { console.log("✗ 导演没通过：", dir.errors.slice(0, 2).join("；")); process.exit(1); }
console.log(`导演完成（${((Date.now() - t0) / 1000).toFixed(0)}s，${dir.obj.beats.length} 个动作）`);
for (const b of dir.obj.beats) console.log(`   ${b.at}：${b.change}`);

// 2) 动画师：代码，错误反馈重写
const t1 = Date.now();
const beatSecs = dir.obj.beats.map((b) => ({ ref: b.at, what: b.change, sec: estimateSec(b.at, ids, texts) - base }));
let last = null;
const anim = await chatJson(model, [{ role: "system", content: ANIMATOR_SYSTEM }, { role: "user", content: animatorUser({ script: dir.obj, sentences: sents, durSec }) }],
  (o) => {
    if (!o?.html || !o?.script) return ['必须输出 {"html":"…","css":"…","script":"…"}，三项都要有'];
    const cues = cuesOf(o.script);
    const r = checkMotion({ html: o.html, css: o.css ?? "", script: o.script, W: 1600, H: 520, dur: durSec, cues, beatCues: beatSecs, sym, tag: `${sceneId}-${fromId}` });
    last = r;
    return r.errs;
  }, { maxRounds: 8, temperature: 0.5, maxTokens: 40000, tag: `manim-${sceneId}-${fromId}`, timeoutMs: 900_000, extra: {} });
let ok = !anim.errors?.length;
let best = ok ? { obj: anim.obj, report: last?.report, score: -1, judge: null } : null;
// 评审闭环：导演要的每个动作，实际画面上真的演出来了吗？不满意就把缺口告诉动画师重写一轮
const judgeModels = flag("--judge-models", flag("--judge-model", "sensenova/glm-5.3,sensenova/kimi-k3")).split(",").map((x) => x.trim()).filter(Boolean);
const JR = +flag("--judge-rounds", "2");
if (ok && JR > 0) {
  let cur = { obj: anim.obj, report: last.report };
  for (let r = 0; r <= JR; r++) {
    const j = await judgeMotionMulti({ models: judgeModels, plan: dir.obj, report: cur.report, sentences: sents, W: 1600, H: 520 });
    if (!j) { console.log("  评审没有返回有效结果，跳过"); break; }
    const sc = j.overall?.score ?? 0;
    console.log(`评审第 ${r} 次：${sc} 分（${(j.overall.scores ?? []).map((x) => x.model.split("/").pop() + " " + x.score).join("，")}）；${j.beats.filter((b) => b.verdict === "ok").length}/${j.beats.length} 个动作演到位${j.overall?.problems?.length ? "；问题：" + j.overall.problems.join(" / ") : ""}`);
    if (!best || sc >= best.score) best = { obj: cur.obj, report: cur.report, score: sc, judge: j };
    const weak = j.beats.map((b, i) => ({ ...b, beat: dir.obj.beats[i] })).filter((b) => b.verdict !== "ok");
    if (sc >= 85 || !weak.length || r === JR) break;
    const fb = `上一版经过评审，这些动作还没演到位，请在保持其他部分的前提下改写（仍然输出完整的 {"html","css","script"}）：\n${weak.map((b) => `- ${b.beat.at}（${b.beat.change}）：${b.note}`).join("\n")}\n整体问题：${(j.overall?.problems ?? []).join("；")}`;
    const again = await chatJson(model, [{ role: "system", content: ANIMATOR_SYSTEM }, { role: "user", content: animatorUser({ script: dir.obj, sentences: sents, durSec }) }, { role: "assistant", content: JSON.stringify(cur.obj) }, { role: "user", content: fb }],
      (o) => {
        if (!o?.html || !o?.script) return ['必须输出 {"html","css","script"}'];
        const rr = checkMotion({ html: o.html, css: o.css ?? "", script: o.script, W: 1600, H: 520, dur: durSec, cues: cuesOf(o.script), beatCues: beatSecs, sym, tag: `${sceneId}-${fromId}` });
        last = rr;
        return rr.errs;
      }, { maxRounds: 6, temperature: 0.5, maxTokens: 40000, tag: `manim2-${sceneId}-${fromId}`, timeoutMs: 900_000 });
    if (again.errors?.length) { console.log("  改写后没通过浏览器检查，保留上一版"); break; }
    cur = { obj: again.obj, report: last.report };
  }
  if (best) { anim.obj = best.obj; ok = true; }
}
console.log(`动画师${ok ? "通过" : "未通过"}（${((Date.now() - t1) / 1000).toFixed(0)}s，${anim.rounds} 轮）${last?.stats ? `  时间线 ${last.stats.duration.toFixed(1)}s，旁白动作 ${last.stats.beatsHit ?? "-"}/${last.stats.beats ?? "-"}` : ""}`);
if (!ok) for (const e of anim.errors.slice(0, 5)) console.log("   -", e);
const out = { at: demo.from, to: demo.to, ok, rounds: anim.rounds, errs: anim.errors ?? [], judge: best?.judge ?? null, score: best?.score ?? null, plan: dir.obj, motion: anim.obj ? { html: anim.obj.html, css: anim.obj.css ?? "", script: anim.obj.script } : null, durSec };
const file = `${outDir}/${sceneId}-${fromId}.json`;
writeFileSync(file, JSON.stringify(out, null, 2));
console.log(`→ ${file}`);
